id:                     E3395
title: 原生生成词法提示与实际Perl运行时绑定
trigger_tool: perl|make
phase: configure|testing
error_signature: generated lexical hints must match the actual target Perl runtime
severity:               2
category:               configure, perl, testing
match_keywords: common::sense, generated module, sense.pm.PL, lexical hints, archlib, target Perl
root_cause: sense.pm.PL在活动Perl中捕获$^H、WARNING_BITS及%^H并写出import实现，归档本身不含sense.pm。安装模块必须绑定实际目标生成器输出和架构安装根，不能与不存在的上游模块文件比较，也不能用异构主机预生成字节替代。
affected_scope: 由运行时生成词法提示的Perl模块
verification_cmd: make -j1 test TEST_VERBOSE=1
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: bind-native-generator-output-and-installed-lexical-behavior
rec_description: 使用已发布的匹配目标Perl执行原MakeMaker及生成器；保持原生成器和2个源测试字节，记录生成器/实际生成文件/安装文件三方SHA256；执行真实安装模块消费者，验证strict-subs负例、UTF8和state正例，再在数字UID自有Harmony目录中验证实际Unicode文件与清理。
rec_command: make -j1 test TEST_VERBOSE=1
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: Keep the original generator and tests unchanged; bind actual native generated bytes and installed architecture module, then verify lexical semantics.
